WEBVTT

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:16.900
The continent of Kunaan was 
ruled by sword and sorcery.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:20.910
Three powerful countries existed there.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:26.080
The Kingdom of Saint Amoria, 
the Kingdom of Ishilfeen,

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:28.990
and the Kingdom of Vanlodis.

00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:32.800
They were all equally powerful,

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.370
and it was clear that any trouble in one

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:39.190
would immediately start
a continent-wide war.

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:47.190
And there was an evil dragon on 
the continent that all men feared.

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:50.720
His name was Dagan Zot.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:57.130
He scorched the earth, and 
brought disaster to the people.

00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:02.910
This is the story of the adventures 
of the swordsman Hiiro,

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:06.950
whose parents were killed by Dagan 
Zot, and who now seeks revenge.

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:11.130
Saraato is the name of a mysterious girl

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:13.710
who joins Hiiro and his
friends on their adventures.

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:20.140
Meanwhile, Hiiro is captured 
with the other men of the town.

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:26.270
It was Tomitte, Giruu, 
and Palupa who saved them,

00:01:26.270 --> 00:01:31.210
while a mysterious woman watched them.

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:21.340
Paradise.

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:45.030
Giruu, is this really breakfast?

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:47.130
No complaining.

00:03:47.130 --> 00:03:51.040
Giruu is doing his best to get by 
with the small budget we've got.

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:53.040
You're just stingy—

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:53.710
This is good!

00:03:57.730 --> 00:04:00.760
They say kids need a big breakfast.

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:03.890
Stop looking down on us, okay?

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:05.310
You're such a snob.

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:08.510
Wipe the smug look off your face and eat.

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:11.430
Young Master, if you've 
finished eating, get ready.

00:04:12.170 --> 00:04:13.530
Ready?

00:04:13.530 --> 00:04:14.910
You know the drill.

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:18.330
More training for you today.

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:19.570
I know.

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:23.530
I'll stay with you all day and instruct you.

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:28.450
And from now on you'll be 
training alone with me.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:36.040
S-Saraato is just following 
me without my permission!

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.420
Then that's even more 
reason to make it just us.

00:04:47.170 --> 00:04:48.560
You can't come today.

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:50.100
Go for a walk or something.

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:54.780
Um...

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.690
Pretty pebble.

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:04.050
Use it if you need something.

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:14.010
Hey, Saraato-chan,

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:15.260
how are you doing?

00:05:15.970 --> 00:05:18.620
I can call you that, right?

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:19.670
Yup.

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:21.710
My name is Erin.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:23.810
I'll take you someplace good.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:33.930
These things again?

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:35.100
I'm getting really sick of—

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:44.540
I'm fine.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:45.580
Go hunt!

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:46.990
No, today...

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:49.250
Go!

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:55.610
The Healing Springs?

00:05:55.610 --> 00:05:56.910
What a kind name!

00:05:57.400 --> 00:06:01.000
It's kind of dried up, 
but it's really famous.

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:05.450
They say a bath here will heal most wounds.

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:08.150
Though it won't bring back
the dead, obviously.

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:09.760
Wounds...

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:12.760
Want to take a bath?

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:17.830
It feels good to have a nice 
chat while you warm up, right?

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:23.210
Hey, take off your clothes!

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:24.590
Is that how it works?

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:26.330
It is!

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:29.990
Hmph. I'm not interested in girls.

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:34.210
<i>What's she doing here?</i>

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:37.660
A monster has appeared 
at the healing springs.

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:41.930
300 gold to the one who captures it!

00:06:41.930 --> 00:06:44.410
300! It says 300!

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:46.670
Can we really get that much?

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:49.630
We need to have Giruu catch it.

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:53.610
If it works we don't have to 
do this petty crap anymore!

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:03.610
Now, Young Master, continue.

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:04.810
I'm done.

00:07:04.810 --> 00:07:05.970
Young Master!

00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:08.670
How long do I have to keep this up?

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:10.740
Dagan Zot appeared.

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:12.980
I've told you many times before...

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:16.110
We can make money on our way.

00:07:16.110 --> 00:07:18.750
If you're not coming, I'll go on my own.

00:07:21.350 --> 00:07:22.250
See?

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:26.180
We're not really hurt,

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:28.160
but doesn't it feel good.

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:29.010
I don't know.

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:32.010
The steam is steamy!

00:07:32.670 --> 00:07:33.990
Man...

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:35.510
This isn't much of a conversation.

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:38.500
You've got pretty skin.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:39.190
Do I?

00:07:39.190 --> 00:07:40.270
Sure you do.

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:43.770
Compared to you, I'm...

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:45.730
This is a waste of time.

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:48.000
I'll be blunt.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:51.500
Young Master, even if you did get the 
Grand Trowa at your current strength,

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:53.410
you couldn't defeat Dagan Zot.

00:07:53.830 --> 00:07:55.010
What?

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:57.910
Every other word you say is about revenge,

00:07:57.910 --> 00:08:01.330
but you only practice 
because I demand you do.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:05.430
If you think you can defeat 
Dagan Zot like this,

00:08:05.430 --> 00:08:06.920
you're pathetic.

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:09.330
Giruu.

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:12.830
A hundred mages acting in 
concert couldn't defeat him.

00:08:13.650 --> 00:08:16.790
You will need the aid of some form of power.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:23.140
But someone who cannot even master the 
basics has no right to challenge him at all.

00:08:23.470 --> 00:08:24.560
You little...

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:26.980
You know far too little of your own strength!

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:30.320
You bastard!

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:33.320
So, where are you from?

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:35.480
Over there.

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:37.780
I'm sure, but...

00:08:38.360 --> 00:08:41.230
<i>It's going to be hard to 
learn anything from her.</i>

00:08:42.590 --> 00:08:43.660
So...

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:46.670
You're with those guys right now, right?

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:47.490
Yes.

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:49.910
That area's filthy, right?

00:08:49.910 --> 00:08:51.190
Doesn't it bother you?

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:52.010
I'm fine.

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:54.550
I'm with everyone, and Hii—

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:58.080
Hii what now?

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:00.180
Hii?

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:02.450
No, nothing.

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:05.440
You guys from Iinsekise?

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:06.150
Yeah.

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:08.340
This is my first day here though.

00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:09.570
You from town, too?

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:13.820
I... No, I come all the time.

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:17.680
A lot of people probably got hurt 
during that trouble with the dragon.

00:09:18.130 --> 00:09:20.450
I was sure the place would be packed.

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:21.800
But nobody's here.

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:25.370
Oh, there's a weird rumor about this place.

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:28.290
There's a nasty monster that lives here

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:30.610
and pops up sometimes.

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:33.390
There's a bounty on it, too, I guess.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:38.170
Well, it doesn't bother me though.

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:39.430
I come here all the time.

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:43.090
You can get a bounty if you catch it?

00:09:43.090 --> 00:09:44.710
Shiny pebbles.

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:47.710
That's a gold piece.

00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:49.270
I'm gathering a lot.

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:50.900
With Hiiro—

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:55.190
I think I've been in here too long.

00:09:57.590 --> 00:09:59.360
My head feels funny.

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:03.240
Damn it!

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:10.790
Young Master,

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:12.910
let me guess what you're thinking.

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:13.630
What?

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:16.130
If I had the Grand Trowa here,

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:17.630
I could beat the crap out of Giruu.

00:10:18.060 --> 00:10:18.950
Fine.

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:20.350
If you insist,

00:10:20.350 --> 00:10:22.220
I'll show you my true power!

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:39.470
Hiiro!

00:10:39.470 --> 00:10:41.230
Giruu, are you insane?!

00:10:41.230 --> 00:10:42.630
What the hell did you do?!

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:44.280
What are you thinking?!

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:46.080
Isn't he on your side?!

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:47.500
How can you do that?!

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:53.840
Wait, don't touch him!

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:55.570
What are you going to do?!

00:10:55.570 --> 00:10:59.840
I'm taking him to the Healing Springs.

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:17.610
Is Sharisharu-sama's plan going to work?

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:21.550
They'll come for the bounty.

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:26.400
Okay, they came!

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:28.200
Let's move!

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:32.210
Aren't you getting cold?

00:11:32.440 --> 00:11:34.890
Don't look at me, would you?

00:11:34.890 --> 00:11:37.070
What's with those "Yes, I have two 
watermelons attached to my chest,

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:39.140
is that a problem?" boobs?

00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:40.310
You think?

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:42.220
I don't think they're that big.

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:45.670
This was a present.

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:46.970
A present?

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.390
I don't think so.

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:50.970
Your present was one gold piece?

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:53.250
Was it from a man?

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:53.850
Yup.

00:11:55.030 --> 00:11:58.020
They think they can trick a girl with that?

00:11:58.020 --> 00:11:59.370
Cheap-ass.

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:00.570
Her boyfriend?

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:02.150
Yup.

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:03.720
He really is a cheap-ass.

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:06.350
But he's also really loud and clingy.

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:08.550
His eyes are pretty like stars.

00:12:09.030 --> 00:12:10.910
His heartbeat goes thud, thud.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.270
A pretty sound.

00:12:12.270 --> 00:12:13.750
I like it.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:15.290
What?

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:16.330
He's loud and clingy,

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:18.660
has star eyes and his heart goes thud, thud?

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:20.340
I'll pass.

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:21.890
I don't even think it even makes sense.

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:25.390
Such nice water.

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:28.400
Wait, this isn't the time for relaxing.

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:29.270
That's right.

00:12:29.270 --> 00:12:30.600
You scared me.

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:34.170
I saw that poster when we were leaving today.

00:12:34.610 --> 00:12:36.950
I figured that if there was 
a healing spring nearby,

00:12:36.950 --> 00:12:40.360
the training could get a little rough.

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:44.740
And if we came here we might get the bounty.

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:46.360
We could kill two birds with one stone.

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:49.100
And so we did.

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:50.450
You figured?

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:53.420
Then you planned to kick 
Hiiro's butt at the start?

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:54.140
No.

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:58.130
I wanted to see how serious 
he was about his revenge.

00:12:58.460 --> 00:12:59.230
Of course,

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:02.430
I didn't expect him to come 
after me that seriously.

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:09.640
This is amazing.

00:13:13.470 --> 00:13:15.690
It's famous around here.

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:17.350
<i>Crap. He's here.</i>

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:18.860
<i>Is that them?</i>

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:22.260
O-Okay, what kind of guy do you like?

00:13:22.260 --> 00:13:23.610
Type?

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:26.910
I'm in love with Nambuuko-sama!

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:28.660
Nambuuko-sama? The arms merchant?

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:30.690
Who else?

00:13:30.690 --> 00:13:33.990
And it's not like I've seen
him somewhere, or I'm a stalker.

00:13:33.990 --> 00:13:37.930
I'm his right arm and his right leg!

00:13:39.850 --> 00:13:41.750
<i>Hiiro didn't have a kid's voice.</i>

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:43.820
<i>Are they not here?</i>

00:13:43.820 --> 00:13:45.510
Then you're in Iinsekise because...?

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:47.830
Oh, that's right.

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:50.260
I'm here to help Nambuuko-sama.

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:53.510
But I'm looking for somebody,

00:13:53.510 --> 00:13:55.570
and I can't find them.

00:13:56.670 --> 00:13:58.090
Sounds rough.

00:13:58.090 --> 00:14:01.060
He's a guy named Hiiro who just came to town.

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:02.930
You know him?

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:03.880
I know him!

00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:11.090
I'm cold.

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:11.920
Aren't you?

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:15.580
You need to get back in the 
water too or you'll catch cold.

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:18.220
Everyone's in place.

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:19.380
Okay.

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:21.080
Wait for Sharisharu-sama's single.

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:24.090
That scar on his chest is huge.

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:25.810
No, that's a birthmark.

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:26.790
A birthmark?

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:28.980
Fortunately, it wasn't bigger than that.

00:14:28.980 --> 00:14:30.170
Bigger than that?

00:14:30.170 --> 00:14:31.090
You mean—

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:34.890
We have to be glad he survived at all.

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:35.810
Was it that bad?

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:36.870
Yeah.

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:38.940
That was the tragedy of Balbagoa.

00:14:39.780 --> 00:14:47.190
This is what I think: that Bairo-sama saved 
the young master then via some method.

00:14:47.480 --> 00:14:49.670
I think I understand for the first time.

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:53.950
His suffering until now has been terrible.

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:55.200
Young Master.

00:14:56.270 --> 00:14:58.660
Sure was.

00:14:58.970 --> 00:15:00.990
I don't let it get to me though.

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:04.960
You're safe?

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:07.090
Yeah, this thing works amazingly.

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:08.840
Young Master.

00:15:11.770 --> 00:15:13.300
<i>It is Hiiro!</i>

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:23.440
I'm sorry.

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:25.770
I will accept your scolding.

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:27.940
I wanted to test your feelings,

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.100
or rather, your resolve.

00:15:30.100 --> 00:15:30.990
Resolve?

00:15:31.500 --> 00:15:33.450
This will be a difficult journey.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:37.150
What we need the most will 
likely not be money or weapons,

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:38.710
or even courage.

00:15:38.710 --> 00:15:39.950
It will be resolve.

00:15:41.150 --> 00:15:45.440
You needed to be willing to go forward,
even if it meant defeating me.

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:47.190
And you were.

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:47.960
Then...

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:52.470
As you say, we can make
the money on our way.

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:54.700
Giruu!

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:57.040
You finally understand!

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:00.180
I'm so glad!

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:11.570
Is Sharisharu-sama's monster here yet?

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:13.530
It's not...

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:15.010
Get it out!

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:20.750
But I'm still worried.

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:22.090
What?

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:24.590
Don't worry about me.

00:16:24.590 --> 00:16:26.560
Or are you worried about money?

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:27.790
Both.

00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:32.160
We need to get some weapons then.

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:33.160
Young Master.

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:34.730
We don't have the cash yet.

00:16:34.730 --> 00:16:36.540
We can at least buy one, right?

00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:40.640
No, unless we see a monster 
that sells for a high price.

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:44.810
And there it is!

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:47.190
Yes!

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:48.440
Begin the operation!

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:49.650
What's going on?

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:51.410
Go!

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:52.900
What?

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:54.760
Catch them?

00:16:55.940 --> 00:16:56.910
Not that way!

00:17:00.070 --> 00:17:01.240
Saraato!

00:17:01.990 --> 00:17:02.790
Saraato?

00:17:03.190 --> 00:17:04.790
Looks like our money's here,

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:05.500
Young Master!

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:09.000
No, not her!

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:10.840
You useless thing!

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:13.290
So it was her doing?

00:17:13.730 --> 00:17:14.970
Time to go!

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:15.850
What's wrong?

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:17.370
We can't control it!

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:23.380
Where did Giruu go?

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:25.210
Hey!

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:26.470
No, no!

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:30.230
Why are you tentacling me?

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:32.650
Sharisharu-sama!

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:34.630
Saraato!

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:37.790
Hiiro!

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:40.220
Saraato!

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:42.580
Let's go, everyone!

00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:02.180
Saraato, answer me if you're here!

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:09.050
Wow!

00:18:09.050 --> 00:18:10.710
That's my Giruu.

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:19.780
Saraato!

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:21.990
Are you okay?

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:26.960
Pretty pebble.

00:18:29.950 --> 00:18:30.960
Hey.

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:34.260
That's quite the situation you're in.

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:39.730
I was just helping her!

00:18:39.730 --> 00:18:40.380
Yeah.

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:42.040
You were helping her.

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:43.330
Completely naked.

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:44.710
You, too.

00:18:44.710 --> 00:18:46.230
Everybody.

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:52.610
So we didn't get the money after all?

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:53.670
Yup.

00:18:53.670 --> 00:18:55.530
I dunno who set it up,

00:18:55.740 --> 00:18:57.390
but evidently it was fake.

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:00.050
But...

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:04.070
Those monster's tentacles 
have a very strange flavor,

00:19:04.070 --> 00:19:07.000
and are popular with the nobility.

00:19:07.230 --> 00:19:09.710
We sold them for a ton.

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:10.910
Yeah?

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:13.690
Great, now we can leave!

00:19:13.690 --> 00:19:15.070
Right, Giruu?

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:15.840
Yes.

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:18.640
We don't know yet where
Nambuuko is, though.

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:20.840
We can look as we go.

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:22.440
Let's buy this!

00:19:22.440 --> 00:19:23.450
No.

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:25.090
Let's buy some chain mail.

00:19:25.090 --> 00:19:26.310
Why?

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:27.220
Idiot.

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:29.640
For the cost of that one weird suit of armor,

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:33.990
we could get chain mail for 
everyone and have money to spare.

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:45.200
Huh, so they're leaving after all?

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:49.310
We won't get that good
food anymore, will we?

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:52.120
Want to ask if they can just have Giruu stay?

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:02.630
Thanks for everything.

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:03.490
Yeah.

00:20:03.490 --> 00:20:04.970
Come back any time.

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:08.470
I guess he didn't come to see us off, did he?

00:20:08.690 --> 00:20:10.100
Of course not.

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:11.470
Think about the kind of guy he is.

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:13.440
I'm going with you!

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:15.730
Tomitte...

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:17.850
Boss, what are you saying?

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:19.150
You can't just—

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:21.760
He needs my help more than you do.

00:20:21.760 --> 00:20:22.700
Boss!

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:24.710
You're leaving us?

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:26.330
You're joking, right?

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:28.770
That's right! Tell me you're joking!

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:31.750
Don't go, boss!

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.830
Boss! No!

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:35.370
I know I'll be back.

00:20:39.270 --> 00:20:40.470
Don't follow me!

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:43.670
You're sure?

00:20:44.530 --> 00:20:47.890
I'm going to get the Grand Trowa,

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:51.200
and change this goddamn world!

00:20:56.910 --> 00:20:58.590
Okay, we're off!

00:21:04.750 --> 00:21:08.600
It was Sharisharu who sent 
that monster after you.

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:12.340
Erin!

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:17.130
Sharisharu? You mean the 
tiny magic user we saw?

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:18.250
Yup.

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:21.130
The plan was to lure you out and catch you.

00:21:22.640 --> 00:21:24.830
So they're after us?

00:21:24.830 --> 00:21:25.800
Hold it.

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:28.850
First, pay back the food you made us buy.

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:31.190
Maybe I'll go with you.

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:33.980
You can't do that.

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:37.160
Then how about this?

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:38.150
What's that?

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:41.150
Where Nambuuko is.

00:21:42.310 --> 00:21:45.320
If you promise me I can go 
with you, I'll tell you.

00:21:45.320 --> 00:21:46.710
Okay, follow us!

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:49.740
Negotiations are a success!

00:21:50.300 --> 00:21:52.970
It's called the Land Where Wishes Die.

00:21:52.970 --> 00:21:54.700
It's supposedly around here.

00:21:55.090 --> 00:21:56.970
Okay, it's around there!

00:21:56.970 --> 00:21:57.800
Let's go!

00:23:44.450 --> 00:23:47.860
<i>Holy War Cerberus: Fatalité of Dragon Time.</i>

00:23:48.000 --> 00:23:55.780
<b>Next time</b>

00:23:48.550 --> 00:23:50.740
Episode 5: "The Sense."

00:23:51.990 --> 00:23:54.030
My blade howls with sadness!

00:23:55.780 --> 00:24:01.750
<b>See You Next Time!!</b>
